CREATED:20260706T164333Z
DESCRIPTION:During this activity\, attendees will learn:\n\n\n* The innate
  immune response is critical to clear normally harmless environmental pat
 hogens\n\n\n* A form of regulated cell death called pyroptosis prevents e
 nvironmental pathogens from infecting macrophages\n\n\n* The innate immun
 e system forms granulomas around a lesion caused by an intracellular path
 ogen that replicates in neutrophils\n\n\n* Understand the visual presenta
 tion of one example of a granuloma response
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260819T150143Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260821T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260819T150143Z
LOCATION;X-BEDEWORK-UID=00f1fcdb-0f068baf-010f-068baf6e-00000000:None
