 e at Duke
CREATED:20260729T210217Z
DESCRIPTION:Meet your JFAMily Sunday\, August 23rd at 5-7 pm in the Freema
 n Center for Jewish Life! Enjoy a free\, kosher\, BBQ style dinner along 
 with games and great company! All Duke students are welcome and encourage
 d to stop by\, whether you're involved with JFAM or not!\n\nWhat is JFAM?
  The Jewish First-year Advisory Mentorship program welcomes new students 
 into the Jewish Life at Duke family by pairing them with upperclass stude
 nts--their "JFAMilies"--who provide insight on campus and Jewish life\, a
 long with guidance\, friendship\, and support. Through on-on-one mentorsh
 ip and various social programs\, new student connect with each other and 
 begin to develop their own community on campus!
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260729T210217Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260823T170000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T210217Z
