CONTACT;X-BEDEWORK-UID=00f1fcdb-0f068baf-010f-068baf83-00000004:None
CREATED:20241218T164928Z
DESCRIPTION:Writing is a brief\, structured practice of responding to a wr
 iting prompt\, followed by time for individual and group reflection. The 
 writing is for you-the participant. This practice is for everyone. You do
  not need to consider yourself a 'writer' to participate. This is not a w
 riting workshop\, and you are never required to share anything you write.
  Participants often report gaining new perspectives\, thinking about expe
 riences in new ways\, and reconnecting with parts of their lives that the
 y value but don't often pause to reflect on.
DURATION:PT30M
DTSTAMP:20260611T163247Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260824T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260611T163247Z
